cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this replication package, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Replication Package: Task Performance and Unaided Programming Performance Divergence among Programming Novices under Generative AI Conditions"
abstract: >-
  De-identified dataset (N = 113 CS1 programming novices) and the complete
  analysis pipeline reproducing all statistics reported in the associated
  manuscript, including Pearson correlations, HC3-robust regressions,
  four-quadrant classification, nested logistic-regression prediction models
  under a leakage-free repeated cross-validation protocol, and
  leave-one-class-out cohort validation.
